  "title": "Easy After-Work Chicken Française",
  "description": "This chicken Française recipe is easy to make with thin chicken breasts simmered in a lemon butter sauce for a quick and tasty weeknight meal.",
  "authors": [
    "GCBENEZRA"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T03:03:30-04:00",
